1
00:00:00,048 --> 00:00:02,418
(Sheldon:)Never mind. I still can't tell you.

2
00:00:05,787 --> 00:00:07,347
(Bernadette:)Penny.

3
00:00:14,262 --> 00:00:16,822
(Bernadette:)- Penny.
- Mmm.

4
00:00:18,566 --> 00:00:19,726
(Bernadette:)Penny.

5
00:00:23,271 --> 00:00:25,571
(Penny:)Oh, my God, Sheldon.

6
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:27,770
(Sheldon:)You frightened me.

7
00:00:31,145 --> 00:00:33,705
(Penny:)What are you doing in my bedroom?

8
00:00:33,881 --> 00:00:36,141
(Sheldon:)I knocked on the front door
but you didn't hear.

9
00:00:36,317 --> 00:00:39,477
- How did you even get in, you weirdo?
- Yeah, yeah, really?

10
00:00:39,654 --> 00:00:42,214
(Sheldon:)I've seen strange men traipsing in
and out of here for years...

11
00:00:42,390 --> 00:00:44,150
(Sheldon:)...but when I do it, it's weird?

12
00:00:45,560 --> 00:00:46,890
(Penny:)What do you want, Sheldon?

13
00:00:47,061 --> 00:00:50,591
Well, I was having a little trouble
sleeping and I just thought...

14
00:00:50,765 --> 00:00:53,565
...you know, seeing as you're up,
we could talk.

15
00:00:54,669 --> 00:00:56,069
(Penny:)Talk about what?

16
00:00:56,237 --> 00:00:59,027
Oh, I don't know. Uh, weather?

